{
 "total": 89.465,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "hook",
   "show": "Claude! I asked for one simple feature. Why did you rewrite half my project?",
   "start": 1.45,
   "end": 5.491
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "hook",
   "show": "Maybe your coding workflow needs an upgrade.",
   "start": 5.791,
   "end": 8.615
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "karpathy",
   "show": "First, Karpathy Skills. These guidelines help me think before coding, keep solutions simple, avoid unnecessary changes and verify the results.",
   "start": 9.215,
   "end": 19.382
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "karpathy",
   "show": "So no more rewriting things I didn't ask you to touch?",
   "start": 20.082,
   "end": 22.814
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "karpathy",
   "show": "That's the idea!",
   "start": 23.314,
   "end": 24.382
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "octopus",
   "show": "But what if you're not sure your solution is the best one?",
   "start": 27.682,
   "end": 30.187
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "octopus",
   "show": "Claude Octopus can help bring multiple AI models into the workflow, compare their approaches and review the findings.",
   "start": 30.687,
   "end": 38.397
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "superpowers",
   "show": "And how do we stop jumping straight into coding before understanding the project?",
   "start": 41.297,
   "end": 45.341
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "superpowers",
   "show": "Superpowers gives us a structured engineering workflow: brainstorm, plan, test, implement and review.",
   "start": 45.841,
   "end": 52.817
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "superpowers",
   "show": "Finally! A plan before the code.",
   "start": 56.717,
   "end": 58.489
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "adhd",
   "show": "Claude, can you explain that without giving me an entire book?",
   "start": 59.289,
   "end": 62.401
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "adhd",
   "show": "Try I Have ADHD. It's designed to make responses more direct, structured and easier to follow.",
   "start": 62.901,
   "end": 70.006
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "adhd",
   "show": "Now that's an answer I can actually use!",
   "start": 73.506,
   "end": 75.672
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "recap",
   "show": "Better instructions, better planning, multiple perspectives and clearer answers.",
   "start": 76.272,
   "end": 80.507
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "recap",
   "show": "Exactly. Better workflows lead to better development.",
   "start": 81.107,
   "end": 84.52
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "closing",
   "show": "Save these four tools before starting your next Claude Code project.",
   "start": 85.12,
   "end": 88.665
  }
 ],
